{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lGuXFhUzme1795141911.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>金價在美國跌近百分之3後，踏入亞洲市跌勢持續，更跌穿3,600美元一盎司。</p><p></p><p>現貨金價一度跌穿3,590美元以下水平。由於市場預期美國聯儲局將於下月議息會議加息，美元匯價連日強勢，加上美股下瀉，市場出現去槓桿情況，拖累貴金屬價格下挫。銀價亦連日下跌，跌至去年9月以來低位。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:44:12.008446+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T02:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T21:17:35.240257+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T03:37:19.578164+00:00","content_hash":"944b9004f2d0c8376227cedbdb61aa6c90c2d20e824d411b1c5210a9a79cf9d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:44:12.008446+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}